<title>USA: Adage Inc Q4 sales up, net, shr loss widen.</title>
<headline>Adage Inc Q4 sales up, net, shr loss widen.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss   $0.32	   profit $0.11</p>
<p> Net shr  loss   0.82	    loss   0.05</p>
<p> Net	loss   4,219	   loss   279</p>
<p> Sales	     17,659		   16,841</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,123,586		5,121,535</p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr loss   $0.04	   profit $0.05</p>
<p> Net shr  loss   0.79	    profit 0.22</p>
<p> Net	loss   4,026	   profit 1,112</p>
<p> Sales	     68,650		   71,236</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,125,637		5,105,860</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The company classified Allister Manufacturing Co subsidiary as a discontinued operation for 1996. The company had a loss from discontinued operations of $2 million and a loss on disposal of $1.8 million. Also contributing to the 1996 net loss was a loss on investments of $643,000.</p>
</text>
